(
    title: "Crayon Shin-chan 2: Ora to Wanpaku Gokko Da zo",
    description: Some("Five stages of side-scrolling action: stomp the bullies chasing Shinnosuke or blow soap bubbles at them, climb poles and trees, duck into shops. Five good-kid stamps hide in each stage — each absorbs a hit that would otherwise cost a life, and collecting every one opens the true ending. Minigames punctuate the stages and also play standalone."),
